      "title": "IPDC: implement proper length checks",
      "message": "IPDC: implement proper length checks\n\nLength checks based on packet data should not be handled through\nDISSECTOR_ASSERT() macros. Install simple length checks to avoid\noverruns instead. Not bothering setting up expert items for this\noutdated protocol.\n\nRefers to #17882\n",
